    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d321">

                <pb facs="0406" n="392" xml:id="pg392"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">800.91293/19: Telegram</note>
                <head>
                    <hi rendition="#italic">The Secretary of State to the
                        Ambassador in China</hi> (<hi rendition="#italic"
                            >Gauss</hi>)</head>
                <opener>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-right">
                        <placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi></placeName>, <date
                            calendar="gregorian" when="1944-04-01T22:00:00-04:00">April 1, 1944—10
                            p.m.</date>
                    </dateline>
                </opener>
                <p>421. Department has brought the problem mentioned in your 556, March 30, 11 a.m.
                    to the attention of the Washington bureau of the Associated Press, which will
                    refer it to New York. Your part in this matter has been duly safeguarded. You
                    will be informed of further developments when they are known.</p>
                <closer>
                    <signed>
                        <hi rendition="#small-caps">Hull</hi>
                    </signed>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
